{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0553_1000_p", "source_sha256": "062042e724f3b29c01754687227b14bb4dca02b0121cd6a00a40611fa2dcd593", "ja": "（ファンタジー映画へ出演したエレナ。亡国の姫を\n護る従者という役を、しっかりやり遂げた！）", "zh": "（艾蕾娜出演了奇幻电影。她出色地完成了守护亡国公主的侍从这一角色！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0553_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "07ec56537f22104466c7b225e946567bfc66cf923e6ac281af83214446b3883a", "ja": "ふぅ～……。なんだか、あっという間だったネ。\nついこの前、撮影が始まったと思ったのに。", "zh": "呼～……总觉得一眨眼就结束了呢。\n明明感觉拍摄才刚开始没多久。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0553_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "6bddfdb5cd5bd18da71eb5b5d754d08c5790a79dd04b246b94b8996b38daac26", "ja": "明日から、もうこの子を演じないんダ……\nって考えると、すごく寂しいナ……。", "zh": "一想到从明天开始就再也不能饰演这个角色了……就觉得好寂寞啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0553_1003_p", "source_sha256": "618c71891567f54aef00f9cb5c8f3339f995bfb9d8fea9028492d7bfc1f489e9", "ja": "寂しい、か。\n撮影中ずっと楽しそうだったもんな。", "zh": "觉得寂寞吗。\n拍摄时你一直看起来都很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0553_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "96cc55cb8e35cb8a04268574ffdfae40b52e6746cd6016137b482c9cc97e6987", "ja": "うん！　みんなと一緒に、いい映画にするゾ～！って\n頑張るのも楽しかったし……。", "zh": "嗯！和大家一起努力把电影拍好，也很开心哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0553_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "29bb67d34ef5f2b77521626a3431e1164f2a8d2283bde286ed1e073f62894ce6", "ja": "ワタシの演じた従者は、みんなのことを大切に\n想ってて、仲間を守る為に立ち向かうような子でショ？", "zh": "我饰演的侍从，是个珍惜大家、会为了保护伙伴挺身而出的孩子，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0553_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "64836970f6414cf71325a4d65a0b2550170598a1d211e1cc53d8e2f2086b5265", "ja": "ワタシも、劇場のみんなのことが大好き！\nだから、そんな子を演じられて、嬉しかったノ♪", "zh": "我也最喜欢剧场的大家了！\n所以能饰演那样的孩子，我真的很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0553_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8f2268ed5e3c21599132be65a90a058abd845868547d9a3d1a9704163a6b5472", "ja": "そうだな。ラストの、みんなを救うために\n戦うところは、本当にカッコ良かったよ！", "zh": "是啊。最后为了拯救大家而战斗的那一幕，真的帅极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0553_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "9abab168583d5ab43f73323bc80b1f5b15b0a46ceb1cf27860e71230ce5f8d75", "ja": "うんうん！　勇気があって、優しい子なんだよネ。\nあ～、もっと演じたかったヨ～！", "zh": "嗯嗯！是个既勇敢又温柔的孩子呢。\n啊～真想再多演一会儿啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0553_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7b9b927cf543f19bffafbcae447b3c82e02efd1e611ef25d0456393a683ba99e", "ja": "ははっ。まあ、撮影は終わってしまったけど、\n大事な仕事がまだ残ってるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "哈哈。虽然拍摄已经结束了，但不是还有重要的工作没完成吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0553_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "a03ef97d5a04e4ab05879f63c181e9d4c27f3f4c887a728fd114df75137f1e56", "ja": "え？　大事なお仕事？", "zh": "诶？　重要的工作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
